    "detailed_description": "In the game you will lead your settlement. You will have to build various buildings starting with a castle and ending with an institute. Every decision you make should be balanced, because the economy of your settlement is growing, and the lack of resources can catch up instantly! Other settlements are not dormant, they are also developing and have their own unique behavior.<br />\r\nIn the game you will meet with various events that can help your settlement as well as harm it! Try to keep your settlement well stocked so that there are fewer and fewer of these events.<br />\r\nLaboratories will help your settlement to discover new types of warriors, which are many times stronger than the usual ones. To start a war with another settlement, you need to click on the enemy's lock and select the corresponding button.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\nWASD - Camera Control<br />\r\nCTRL + Mouse Wheel - Control Zoom<br />\r\nRight mouse button - Build/Select<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n- pleasant and simple graphics;<br />\r\n- simple controls;<br />\r\n- interesting gameplay;<br />\r\n- light music;<br />\r\n- unforgettable adventures;",
